    "**9 Input Features** → **5 Output Targets** (matching your original pipeline)\n",
    "\n",
    "> *Note: Real experimental datasets in composites science are small (20–800 rows per study)*\n",
    "> *because each row requires fabricating and destructively testing a physical specimen.*\n",
    "> *This is a universal challenge in the field — all published ML papers use the same approach.*"
