    "---\n",
    "## 📚 OPTION 1: Multi-Source Literature Data Fusion\n",
    "### Strategy: Extract tabular data from 8 peer-reviewed papers (DOI-cited)\n",
    "Each row below corresponds to a real specimen with measured mechanical properties.\n",
    "Features are harmonised to a common 9-column schema across all sources.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Input Schema (9 features):**\n",
    "- `fiber_type` | `matrix_type` | `fiber_wt_pct` | `layer_count` | `specimen_thickness_mm`\n",
    "- `fiber_orientation_deg` | `surface_treatment` | `fabrication_method` | `filler_wt_pct`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Output Schema (5 targets):**\n",
    "- `tensile_strength_mpa` | `flexural_strength_mpa` | `impact_strength_jm2` | `hardness_hv` | `density_g_cm3`"
   ]
  },

